    "body": "We don't need to add an attribute for this. How files are uploaded to an input type=file is a browser UI concern, and browsers can make it work any way they want. Currently most seem to choose a button, but they could do dropping, typing a file path, dictating a filesystem search with speech, ... UI is entirely up to the browser.\r\n\r\nSo I think the best route here is for you to file bugs on browsers you care about asking them to add your preferred input method (in this case, dropping) to their input type=file implementation. This is basically out of scope of the spec.\r\n\r\nAs such, I'll close this issue, but we can continue discussing in the closed thread if you are not convinced.",
